            "title": "French Fitness",
            "text": "<p>Distributed exclusively by Fitness Superstore Inc, the French Fitness brand has made a mark among fitness enthusiasts and gym owners for its commercial grade quality at competitive price points. French Fitness offers everything you need for a commercial or home gym. All products are sold brand new, with a standard 10 years parts, 1 year labor warranty.</p>",
