    "scrollable_faq_69hXTR": {
      "type": "scrollable-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "block_FKLaLA": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_1869_b3ad2266-b71c-48cf-9b1f-8a5bf21c8b74.png",
            "title": "Top Quality Remanufactured Gym Equipment",
            "text": "<p>At Fitness Superstore, quality is our top priority. Our equipment undergoes a rigorous inspection, testing, and quality assurance process to ensure that every machine meets our high standards. We meticulously refurbish and test our remanufactured products to deliver top-tier performance at mid-range prices, making high-quality fitness equipment accessible to all.</p>",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "Explore remanufacturing process",
            "link_url": "#"
          }
        },
        "block_dG6c77": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_1869_1188689a-69d0-46b6-bb50-a0e9921c1f68.png",
            "title": "Extensive and Top of the Industry Remanufactured Warranty",
            "text": "<p>Our confidence in the quality of our remanufactured equipment is backed by a 1-year parts and labor warranty, with options to extend up to 5 years. For brand new equipment, we maintain the original manufacturer’s warranties. This extensive warranty coverage ensures that you can invest in our products with peace of mind, knowing that we stand behind the durability and performance of our gym equipment.</p>",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": ""
          }
        },
        "block_YnmfN7": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_1869_fe21439c-e26b-49d9-b41d-d50a339f9e9f.png",
            "title": "Parent Company of French Fitness With 10-Year Warranty",
            "text": "<p>We offer products that are nearly equal in quality to some of the world’s most trusted brands of gym equipment while maintaining affordability. With the advantage of being run by the same people as Fitness Superstore, we have extensive knowledge and experience on handling some of the best commercial gym equipment in the market. Plus, we offer a 10-year parts warranty and 1-year labor warranty on all our products besides weights and accessories. We are committed to providing you with the best value for your money.</p><p>Our showroom is available for customers to inspect our products and compare them to your favorites from other brands. You can visit in person, or by way of a live facetime call as we have staff to assist. Whether you’re looking to purchase for your home gym or are building a commercial fitness center, it helps to check out the equipment first-hand and see / perform live use.</p>",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "Learn more",
            "link_url": "#"
          }
        },
        "block_AKzV6M": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_1869_ff1daf1c-80e0-4378-b4b9-9a28b31fe0c8.png",
            "title": "Top-Rated Across Platforms",
            "text": "<p>Fitness Superstore is trusted by thousands of clients worldwide. Our consistent 5-star ratings across various platforms reflect our unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction. These top ratings are a testament to the quality of our products and the excellence of our customer service. When you choose Fitness Superstore, you're choosing a brand that is highly regarded and trusted by fitness enthusiasts and professionals alike.</p>",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "View Reviews",
            "link_url": "#"
          }
        },
        "block_ntryjd": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_1869_6cdb882b-8dea-4c23-83e4-874862845b13.png",
            "title": "Established Industry Leader",
            "text": "<p>With over 14 years of expertise and a dedicated team of over 100 experts, Fitness Superstore has solidified its position as a trusted gym equipment manufacturer in the United States. Our deep-rooted experience and unwavering commitment to quality have made us a leading name in the fitness industry. Whether you're looking for new or remanufactured equipment, you can trust that we have the knowledge and capability to meet your fitness needs with precision and excellence.</p>",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": ""
          }
        },
        "block_zDgXRA": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_1869_d95f628a-badc-4d84-96db-7a9a6fcde44b.png",
            "title": "Dedicated Customer Service",
            "text": "<p>From the initial inquiry to post-purchase support, Fitness Superstore is committed to providing exceptional customer service every step of the way. Our team is always ready to assist with sales inquiries, repairs, and warranty claims, ensuring you receive prompt and effective solutions. Our dedication to customer satisfaction is a cornerstone of our business, reflecting our core values of transparency and integrity.</p>",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": ""
          }
        },
        "block_w49nA8": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_1869_9a1b2ac6-0019-4f87-94f6-9b9130874f6d.png",
            "title": "Full Service Delivery and Assembly Options",
            "text": "<p>We are one of the few gym equipment manufacturers that offer full-service options at a reasonable price. Having our own fleet of delivery vehicles, 50+ warehouse manpower, and partnerships with the top local and global couriers allows us to provide you with convenient options. We offer curbside delivery, installation/assembly, and room-of-choice delivery options for US-based clients. For foreign customers, we also provide various shipping choices to help you select the best setup.</p>",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "Learn more",
            "link_url": "#"
          }
        },
        "block_nXHD97": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_1869_4e3944ea-0d35-4ad2-9d75-5abbaa3f9011.png",
            "title": "Full-scale Customization and Personalization",
            "text": "<p>We offer an extensive range of customization options to meet your unique needs. Choose from any Pantone or RAL color for paint, a variety of upholstery choices, and even carved logos to represent your institution. These features allow you to express your distinct style and goals, whether you're creating a home gym or a commercial fitness center. We take pride in providing these customizable features, ensuring your gym equipment truly embodies your brand and personality.</p>",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "See more",
            "link_url": "#"
          }
        },
        "block_Lch3Ab": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_1869_66f321e3-1955-42ea-82e2-96e169702006.png",
            "title": "CEO-led Customer Care",
            "text": "<p>Our CEO's personal oversight of customer satisfaction ensures that critical issues are addressed swiftly and effectively. This hands-on approach demonstrates our commitment to exceptional service and reinforces our dedication to resolving any concerns our customers may have. With our CEO directly involved, you can trust that your satisfaction is our top priority.</p>",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "See more",
            "link_url": "#"
          }
        },
        "block_fGB4ei": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image_d7bc582a-36c1-4c43-a130-fe948f567915.png",
            "title": "Accessible Showroom & Warehouse",
            "text": "<p>We invite our clients to visit our showroom and warehouse to witness our quality control and equipment testing processes firsthand. This transparency allows potential customers to inspect our gym equipment before making a purchase, ensuring they are fully confident in their investment. Our accessible showroom and warehouse are a testament to our commitment to openness and customer trust.</p>",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": ""
          }
        }
      },
