        "question_i8ceMK": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Should I buy remanufactured gym machines from Fitness Superstore or brand new direct from the manufacturer? Why should I go for remanufactured?",
            "text": "<p>Fitness Superstore's remanufactured gym equipment offers the same workout experience as brand new machines, at a fraction of the cost. Our remanufactured machines serve the same purpose and come with generous warranties, ensuring quality and best value for money. In essence, customers get all the essentials without any downsides in terms of price, functionality, and durability by choosing Fitness Superstore's remanufactured gym equipment.</p>",
            "url_text": "",
            "url_link": ""
          }
        },
        "question_HYNqGB": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Which should I buy: remanufactured from Fitness Superstore or used gym equipment on Craigslist, eBay, Facebook, or marketplace for cheap? What do you offer that a retailer on online selling platforms do not offer?",
            "text": "<p>Fitness Superstore provides guarantees through our extensive warranties on parts and labor, our own fleet of delivery vehicles for local shipments, best rates on installation and assembly services, stress-free international shipping, and responsive after-sales support. Unlike most retailers selling used equipment on public listing pages, we are an established company that delivers thoroughly inspected and quality-assured products, guiding you through every step of your ordering process down to warranty claims.</p>",
            "url_text": "",
            "url_link": ""
          }
        },
        "question_AVVXQn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Should I buy remanufactured gym equipment from Fitness Superstore or their competitor who offers the same item at a lower price, but doesn't have the same reputation? ",
            "text": "<p>The core reason for our stellar reputation that sets Fitness Superstore apart from competitors is how we go above and beyond to deliver excellent customer service. To us, it’s not just about seeking 5-star reviews across various customer review platforms. Your experience with the brand is our top priority. We address inquiries, issues, and warranty claims quickly and efficiently because we want you to feel confident that you received the best value for your money. If you want to have a stress-free experience, from ordering to deliver or installation, then Fitness Superstore is sure to deliver.</p>",
            "url_text": "",
            "url_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
